    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait er? that sounds super intense. i thought it was just a pulled muscle or something. are you sure it's that bad? i've seen people on tiktok do these crazy spinal decompressions and yoga stretches and they look fine after. if i just do some deep forward folds and maybe some intense twisting, won't that just release the pressure on the nerve? i'm kinda scared to go to the hospital and have them do surgery or something, can i just try managing it myself for a few days first?",
